Now you can add the `kubernetes.io/ingress-bandwidth` and `kubernetes.io/egress-bandwidth`
annotations to your Pod. For example:

```yaml
apiVersion: v1
kind: Pod
metadata:
  annotations:
    kubernetes.io/ingress-bandwidth: 1M
    kubernetes.io/egress-bandwidth: 1M
...
```

